{"id":"591159393","kind":"article","title":"文字解释已经很不错了","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Word_explanations_are_already_great"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2022-12-12","updated":"2026-10-28","votes":10,"comment_count":7,"minutes":1,"chars":346,"keywords":["文字解释","解释学","数学教育","学习材料设计"],"summary":"译文认为，写得好的纯文字解释已经足够有力；若解释离开文字便无法成立，添加图片、视频或互动形式也无法弥补。作者指出，如何系统写出优质文字解释仍未有明确方法。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/591159393","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"LGrnTHhh\">我最近在阅读  <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.comhttps//math.stackexchange.com/a/498790/35525\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://math.stackexchange.com/a/498790/35525</a>，它让我注意到了，如果你会写的话，只有文字的解释（没有图片、视频、交互组件、动画、间隔重复、多选题）就已经很好了。我认为人类文明仍然不知道如何撰写文字解释，如果继续这样下去，我们尽管能在文字上堆砌各种花招，我们仍然无法产出优质的解释。如果解释材料以文字的形式无法立住，那么这个解释就是糟糕的。</p><p data-pid=\"rhe7S89q\">如何写出非常优秀的文字解释，这点上还有很多尚未明晰的地方： <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/We_still_don't_know_how_to_systematically_write_great_word_explanations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> </p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"vaghoxiB\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Potpourri_hypothesis_for_math_education\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学教育的博采众长假设</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"OYKS6OSy\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explanation_science\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">解释学</a> <sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"EozbP2Em\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Word_explanations_are_already_great\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Word explanations are already great</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"657707474\" href=\"#/post/657707474\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 数学教育的杂烩假说 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698931449\" href=\"#/post/698931449\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 解释学 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"574139400\" href=\"#/post/574139400\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"587804911","title":"好动机有什么特点？","author":"Issa Rice","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"591675068","title":"解释材料中假设了工作记忆容量是无限的","author":"Issa Rice","votes":33,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"657707474","title":"我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法","author":"Issa Rice","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"698931449","title":"数学教育的杂烩假说","author":"Issa Rice","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"574139400","title":"解释学","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}